{"version":1,"content":"<p>外電報道，巴基斯坦以「一個中國」政策為由，對台灣航空公司關閉領空，成為全球首個採取此類舉措的國家。</p><p>台灣外交部昨嚴厲譴責巴基斯坦扈從中國大陸，漠視國際現實、嚴重貶抑台灣主權，以及將空域政治化及武器化。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:42.057543+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:28:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:18:10.009819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.278827+00:00","content_hash":"bd676d4c3c148783192dbd3bb21437b8ba0919f393f1794f41d34186439fccac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}